HAPI adapts the recap prompt, bounded history selection, and temporary structured
request workflow from OpenAI Codex commit
94ca55a93c11348c6e3431e292b8e9a33dfefc82 into TypeScript in codexRecapPrompt.ts
and codexRecap.ts. HAPI adds daemon transport adapters, source freshness checks,
and cleanup handling. The copied upstream notice above is retained for attribution.
